{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-e403ba22275a","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-e403ba22275a","name":"杨枝甘露","category":"drink","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/drink/%E6%9D%A8%E6%9E%9D%E7%94%98%E9%9C%B2.md","blob_sha":"fa8ba5b7815fac829991281c11be6ad420516a74","details":{"introduction":"这是一道改良版的经典港式甜品，用奇亚籽代替西谷米，口感滑嫩又带有籽粒的细微嚼劲，芒果的香甜与葡萄柚的微酸交织，椰奶增添浓郁。富含膳食纤维、维生素 C 和优质脂肪，清爽解暑。制作非常简单，新手也能轻松完成，从备料到享用只需约 20 分钟。","difficulty":"★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 杯子\n- 水果刀\n- 牛奶\n- 冰块\n- 调理机/果汁机"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"每份：\n\n- 奇亚籽 24g\n- 牛奶 50ml\n- 冰块 2 小块\n- 芒果 1 粒\n- 葡萄柚 1/2 粒\n- 椰奶 150ml\n\n点缀:\n\n- 切丝芒果干 （可选）\n- 切丝柳橙干 （可选）"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 奇亚籽泡牛奶 10 分钟。\n2. 泡籽之时，把半粒芒果、葡萄柚去皮切丁，放入杯中。\n3. 半粒芒果切小块放入调理机加冰块、椰奶打成泥。\n4. 倒入杯中，放上点缀材料（如有）。\n5. 一边享用一边写代码！！"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：奇亚籽30g、3.25%全脂牛奶100g、芒果果肉300g、红心葡萄柚果肉100g、椰奶180g、饮用水50g；整份约760g。按原文奇亚籽改良版，非西米版；芒果葡萄柚去皮去核净重，椰奶限定USDA通用未加糖椰浆，冰全部融化，无干果点缀；原文ml均改为独立称克标准。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":110.894737,"protein_g":2.033158,"carbohydrate_g":10.931842,"fat_g":7.447368},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170554/nutrients","version":"d4ede2188d8afe0a","fdc_ids":[170554,172217,169910,174673,170172,173647]},"profile_id":"family-e403ba22275a-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-e403ba22275a","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-e403ba22275a","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"cold_mix","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-e403ba22275a-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"chia","grams":30},{"key":"milk","grams":100},{"key":"mang